Cell["\<\
The frame at time 3, drawn without the viewer, on the diamond lattice, a \
sprinkling into two-dimensional Minkowski space and the cylinder lattice.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e67bb521-7b75-43e7-b3b9-9f55b796912e"],

